{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120105832652-1120_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261120111904\"/><p>一名女子倒斃小西灣邨單位房間內。</p><p>今日(20日)早上10時27分，一名女子報案，指懷疑其37歲女兒在小西灣邨瑞發樓寓所房間內暈倒。人員接報到場破門入內，經檢驗證實事主已氣絕，人員正了解女子病歷及生前狀況，遺體稍後由仵工舁送殮房，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T03:44:11.969305+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T02:58:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T04:37:27.959934+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T03:37:28.790679+00:00","content_hash":"fc55b0d4793efbb269b3816db885ae55be1c7e24b61070791ff743ce85cb33ee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}